    "long_instructions": "\r\n# Need More Clarification?\r\n\r\n#### The previous level instructed you to use the **backpack feature**.\r\n\r\n#### The backpack feature in coding platforms allows you to save and reuse code across different projects.\r\n\r\n#### Expand the boxes below to review how to use the backpack feature.\r\n\r\n<details style=\"background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;\">\r\n<summary style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\">How to Save to the Backpack</summary>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 20px;\">\r\n\r\n#### Students should get in the habit of saving their files after each level they build in it. This way, they can easily access the code on future projects. \r\n\r\n- #### Click the three-dot menu icon next to the `index.html` file name.\r\n- #### Select \"Save to backpack\" from the drop-down menu.\r\n- #### Name the file and press save.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://images.code.org/a5083c7ccc54bfa4ea561fa29adf2902-image-1740077664809.gif\" alt=\"gif of how to use the backpack\" width=\"650px\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\r\n\r\n</div></details>\r\n<details style=\"background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;\">\r\n<summary style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\">How to Import From the Backpack </summary>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 20px;\">\r\n\r\n#### Students can import their previous work to use on current projects. \r\n\r\n- #### Click the `+` icon next to the File menu.\r\n- #### Select \"Import from backpack\" from the drop-down menu.\r\n- #### Select your file and click the \"Import to project\" button.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://images.code.org/f53f681651f42c532cf0c7078fc14099-image-1740078209718.gif\" alt=\"gif of how to use the backpack\" width=\"650px\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></details>\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Step-by-Step Tutorial of the Previous Level\r\n\r\n#### Note sure about the last level? Check out this quick tutorial for a step-by-step walk through.\r\n\r\n"
  },
